<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SOCCER-LEADING CZECH CHAMPIONSHIP SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING CZECH CHAMPIONSHIP SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers after 17 rounds</p>
<p>of the Czech Republic soccer championship:</p>
<p>13 - Radek Drulak (Petra Drnovice)</p>
<p>10 - Vitezslav Tuma (FC Karvina)</p>
<p>7 - Radovan Hromadko (FK Jablonec), Martin Cizek (Sparta</p>
<p>Prague), Horst Siegl (Sparta Prague), Jozef Majoros (Petra</p>
<p>Drnovice), Karel Vacha (Slavia Prague), Martin Barbaric</p>
<p>(Slovan</p>
<p>Liberec), Ladislav Fujdiar (SK Ceske Budejovice)</p>
</text>
